{
  "_comment": [
    "Declarative part of the UI contract. Everything that can be derived by",
    "driving the page (no JS errors, no missing ids, no dead controls, tab",
    "bijection, confirm-gating, no endpoint errors) is asserted by run.mjs",
    "for every page automatically; this file only adds what cannot be derived:",
    "which endpoints a page must have called, which tabs form a group, which",
    "controls must not be stuck disabled, and what a destructive request must",
    "look like. Add a page here when you add one to the app \u2014 test_ui_integration",
    "fails if the app serves an HTML page with no spec."
  ],
  "blockMutations": [
    ".*"
  ],
  "allowHttpErrors": [],
  "expectInert": [],
  "fixtures": [
    {
      "path": "^/api/jobs/",
      "status": 200,
      "body": {
        "id": 4242,
        "kind": "harness",
        "status": "success",
        "target": "harness-job",
        "log": "[harness] job finished",
        "started": 1,
        "finished": 2
      }
    }
  ],
  "pages": [
    {
      "name": "dashboard",
      "path": "/",
      "expectTitle": "Status",
      "expectRequests": [
        "/api/router",
        "/api/comfyui",
        "/api/services",
        "/api/updates/llamacpp",
        "/api/updates/comfyui",
        "/api/hf/status",
        "/api/gpu"
      ],
      "expectVisible": [
        "#router-state",
        "#tps",
        "#router-feed",
        "#comfy-state",
        "#comfy-feed",
        "#update-llamacpp",
        "#update-comfyui",
        "#update-huggingface",
        "#update-python",
        "#update-gpu",
        "#build-select",
        "#upd-btn",
        "#build-count",
        "#switch-build-btn",
        "#delete-build-btn"
      ],
      "expectEnabled": [
        "#update-llamacpp button.btn-primary-sm",
        "#upd-btn",
        "#comfy-upd-btn",
        "#hf-upd-btn",
        ".update-tab"
      ],
      "expectAbsent": [
        "#upd-releases",
        "#upd-sdk"
      ],
      "expectDisabled": [
        "#switch-build-btn",
        "#delete-build-btn"
      ],
      "_selectCases_comment": [
        "The delete button's entire safety story is which selection unlocks",
        "it: the build the router is running must never be deletable or",
        "switchable to, and any other stored build must be both."
      ],
      "selectCases": [
        {
          "select": "#build-select",
          "note": "current build is locked",
          "choose": {
            "labelContains": "current"
          },
          "expectDisabled": [
            "#switch-build-btn",
            "#delete-build-btn"
          ]
        },
        {
          "select": "#build-select",
          "note": "a stored build is unlocked",
          "choose": {
            "labelNotContaining": "current"
          },
          "expectEnabled": [
            "#switch-build-btn",
            "#delete-build-btn"
          ],
          "expectDisabled": [],
          "then_click": [
            "#switch-build-btn",
            "#delete-build-btn"
          ],
          "_then_click_comment": [
            "Destructive endpoints behind a selection-dependent button are clicked",
            "here, against a known selection; the sweep only reaches them in whatever",
            "state the select was left in."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "_fixtures_comment": [
        "GET fixtures for the update tabs: they make the deploy/rollback buttons",
        "live so their requests can be asserted, and make the dashboard render",
        "the same way on any machine. The real endpoints are covered by",
